  "title": "Themes: Match QMenuBar and QToolBar background color to our theme",
  "description": "On KDE (Breeze), QMenuBar and QToolBar do not respect the standard\nQPalette::Window by default in order to have the colors match that\nof the window title bar, which is set by the KDE theme. That doesn't\nlook good, especially when the QToolBars contain other widgets that\nare affected by our theme. Actually changing the title bar color to\nmatch our theme from KDE is possible but more difficult. Also note\nKDE uses different colors for active and inactive by default.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
